  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">InfoDev is an initiative run in cooperation by the IFC and the World Bank. InfoDev is set-up as a global and multi-donor program with the overall goal of supporting growth oriented entrepreneurs and enterprises, through provision and support to innovation and financing, cooperation and networking, mentoring, investors and technology development. Agreement is for core-support to infoDev&apos;s programme</narrative>
  </description>
